; ＠備考◆周りの声が聞こえてない感じ

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHanna.1_5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@Wait WaitMode:0.1
@ShakePerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 Force:0.01,-0.01,0 Frequency:1800 DampingRatio:0 Randomly:false Duration:180

@PrintDebateText Text:"不要……不要……<br>为什么我会<link=\"Objection_02_05_22_01\">做出这种事</link>……|#0205Trial22_Hanna001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHanna.1_4

@PrintDebateText Text:"为什么我会<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_22_02\">杀人</link>……？<br>把蕾雅杀了……<br>把艾玛杀了……！|#0205Trial22_Hanna002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@PrintDebateText Text:明明她们<br>根本没有罪过……！|#0205Trial22_Hanna003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@PrintDebateText Text:"而且……<br>我这么罪孽深重，<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_22_03\">雪莉</link>竟然要陪我一起……|#0205Trial22_Hanna004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; ＠備考◆泣く

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHanna.1_5

@PrintDebateText Text:呜呜……<br>啊啊啊啊……！|#0205Trial22_Hanna005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.7
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@Wait WaitMode:0.1
@ShakePerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 Force:0.01,-0.01,0 Frequency:600 DampingRatio:0 Randomly:false Duration:60

@PrintDebateText Text:……汉娜！<br>你振作一点！|#0205Trial22_Hiro001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

